                     "description":"Welcome to Butler Eighteen by Wiseman, located in West LA. This community has thirty-six units featuring studio, one, and two-bedroom apartment homes ranging from 486-1,756 Sq Ft.\n\nProperty Features: \n\nCovered Parking\nWalkability Score of 64/100\nBikeable Score of 60/100\nPublic Transit Score of 79/100\nApartment Features:\n\nEnergy-Efficient Appliances\nCentral Heating \u0026 AC\nVinyl Flooring\nPatio\nButler Eighteen is located south of Santa Monica Blvd and east of Barrington Ave., near Santa Monica College, Westwood, UCLA, Sawtelle JapanTown, Whole Foods, Brentwood shopping, and many popular restaurants and nightlife. The 405 and 10 freeways are within minutes' driving distance, making this property a gateway to the LAX airport, Downtown LA, Santa Monica, and Venice. \n\nWe are pet-friendly; your cats and dogs are welcome. \n\nIn-person and virtual tours are available by appointment.\n\nExperience Good Living at Butler Eighteen by Wiseman.",
